<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Such oneness, like anointing oil</l><l>On head to body poured;</l><l>Such oneness, like the morning dew,</l><l>With sweet refreshment stored.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>To those who dwell in brotherhood</l><l>The Lord His blessing sends,</l><l>He crowns them with the bliss of life,</l><l>Of life that never ends.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
